=== TARGET 4: Steiger Z = 16.2 ===
DATA_INFEASIBLE: Steiger Z requires VXEEM data.

Steiger (1980) / Meng et al. (1992) formula analysis with paper values:

With n=1257 (Nov2020-Mar2026 window), paper values (rho1=0.595, rho2=0.459):
Using Steiger (1980) formula: Z = (arctanh(r1)-arctanh(r2)) / sqrt(2/n*(1-r12))
